<!--
  Cleared: a closed square with a tick.

  The square is the point. `verdict_unsure` is the same square with its sides
  taken out and `verdict_flagged` is an octagon, so the three marks differ in
  silhouette before any colour or word resolves. Redrawn from
  the hand-drawn source SVG verdict-cleared.svg (kept outside this app's own tree); the rect
  there is a path here because a VectorDrawable has no rect element.
-->
